35,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The late-turn pool is empty. Overtime is covering the final departures.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"@Asuka, the stopwatch says the surface route is slow, but the platform clears fast.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"@Takumi, the ledger shows the capital grant is gone. The maintenance contract is the only real money left.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Servas,,"@Benjamin, the pilots from eight years ago succeeded. The accessibility programme failed on the lanes.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"@Servas, the minutes show the ferry and rail offices never agreed on data terms.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, if the maintenance contract is the only money, we must protect the lift crews.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Asuka, protecting crews is good, but the journey audit says the minutes are lost in the wait.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Takumi, the wait is cheap. The lift repair is expensive. The ledger does not lie.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Benjamin, the ledger is a map, not the territory. The pilots prove the tech works.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Servas, the tech works, but the data terms are missing. The ferry and rail offices are silent.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Asuka,,I will not promise a plan that requires crews we do not have.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Takumi,,I will not promise a plan that ignores the stopwatch. The surface route is the problem.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will not promise a plan that ignores the ledger. The maintenance contract is the only real money.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Servas,,I will not promise a plan that ignores the past. The pilots succeeded. The lanes failed.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will not promise a plan that ignores the silence. The data terms are missing.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
